<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-18T22:14:09.140Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:14:09 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army and allied forces have claimed heavy losses inflicted on RSF near the Chad border while continuing advances toward RSF strongholds in West Kordofan and the Blue Nile. RSF drone strikes have killed at least 1,630 civilians, hitting markets, hospitals and fuel sites, prompting Amnesty International to call for war crimes investigations into attacks on El Obeid. Sudanese courts have sentenced RSF chief Hemedti and 13 others to death in absentia, and a Sudanese court sentenced the head of the RSF to death in absentia. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibEFVX3lxTE96eDNiOFJCMkpXOXFNQWRIaFJJNkZtSlpDbU11X3E3Y1NLX3llLTR5ZVpzTS1pQ0hndmhGQ0VRVVNWOEowQWJDblJKSWhhUHQ4Mi04cEFiMl95Qy00cTE4OFZfM3hIZkJtc2tGbQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Business Insider Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxNd1Y1alF6c21EVDNEWWktbWJWdWVvY1MzWV95a2xhUF8tY0FBZFFKYWlSZGpyc1BRMnV3eHpKbTJJQ3BYeENqNTlpS3FhRDJkX0htbEU3TkZiNWNJQVVncEdpTlN1djV2MnNsWk1UZ2lKSU1jbW5lVGd1cVFaN2lZdXN0Vkl6WEF1elYyaXdPODN5RDBlRENGZUlISTdFTV9XZW5HT0hrUnpIR3lMWnVpSjdFRmdnM25BZnlfRTAxR0haR1FiQnhnMy1DWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Business Insider Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNS0hzNllnNWhJc3pIMmllOFgwaDBRSjFzTWlteHViVDNqZUlkX05iN29ZYU1Pd1BHUWpSSDMzWU5Yd2ozdFZFSDNacW04SFdBSFYxT2ZaYUxYMkE0RlVUV3JvQ1RWbEZpSHhzZHR3WUtBcG1FNk5Sc1lySGtyR3BSNEpNRl9ITjBkak1fd203djdEeklseHlXOHo5MDA2U3NVN0RYZDlTSVdoOEJJZkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Operativ Məlumat Mərkəzi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articl